0011-p2p-bar1.patch, with HAL selection and PTE rewrites scoped to CMP GPUs.
Applied only for --p2p. See docs/P2P.md.

--- a/src/nvidia/src/kernel/gpu/bus/kern_bus.c
+++ b/src/nvidia/src/kernel/gpu/bus/kern_bus.c
@@ -58,6 +58,17 @@
